    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12121" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπῐνύσσω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πινυτός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lack
				understanding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοκέεις δέ μοι οὐκ ἀπινύσσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.342
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				6.258
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ ἀπινύσσων,</span> of one
				<i>lying senseless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.10
			</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπινυτέω.</span>
			</div>
